; The one he missed (.ai/merlin.md): the title screen's blue-robed figure, who hid while every other wizard was
; taken (the prologue). Eric, 2026-11-02: "merlin is perfect, as one that uses his magic to protect others."
; Playable once every chapter's boss has fallen on Default or harder (the_one_he_missed); outside the campaign
; gate, since he was never imprisoned. He opens on Orb of Ages, his alone (UnlockDefinition.ExclusiveTo): a ward
; drawn where he stands and the orb of his staff ricocheting in it. His passive is Warding Hand: whatever touches
; him is thrown back.
